+test('MODS1: WORDS IN THE PLAYER\'S LANGUAGE - a module\'s dfo.t reads the game\'s own table in the player\'s language (the player: "sync with DFO language so we don\'t need to create translation"), the English where it has no row, every {name} filled; a host with no text core, or a failing one, gives the English', () => {
